                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>998.3 kWh</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• Demand reaches its highest level around </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Periods 9–10</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>• The forecast shows </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>variation in electricity demand across the 24 periods</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
