                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The electricity demand forecast covers 24 future periods.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Predicted demand ranges from approximately 998.3 kWh to 1,263 kWh, with an average demand of 1,115 kWh.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Demand reaches its highest level around Periods 9–10 and remains relatively stable across the forecast horizon.</run>
